  * A client gone without a word (killed) loses its session: a write to its
    closed socket stops its sensor (it streamed into the dead socket at
    ~100 Hz, keeping the phone awake all night); the socket's error signal
    connected by its Qt6 name (errorOccurred); a lost session not on any
    sensor's list is stopped on every channel and its socket dropped.

